    description: Some("A conductor bounces through a maze gathering musical notes, but only in the order the display calls for — touch the wrong note and he ricochets off it, usually into something hostile. Push up or down as he lands to control how high he bounces, and once the whole song is collected the treble clef sets it playing, briefly making everything safe to touch."),
